,{"children":"底盘增加独立悬挂并重新配重，降低重心；把加速度限制做成可调参数，让操作手在不同场地上都能有稳定的手感。"}],["$","p","云台重新做动平衡，相机与枪管刚性连接，减少相对位移。",{"children":"云台重新做动平衡，相机与枪管刚性连接，减少相对位移。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","硬件",{"id":"section-4","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"04"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"硬件"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","全向轮底盘 + 悬挂模组、两轴云台、拨盘发射机构、主控与自绘分电板、IMU 与相机。",{"children":"全向轮底盘 + 悬挂模组、两轴云台、拨盘发射机构、主控与自绘分电板、IMU 与相机。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","软件",{"id":"section-5","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"05"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"软件"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","底盘速度解算、云台双环控制、发射热量管理、遥控与 CAN 通信；自瞄开启时云台跟随视觉给定，关闭时回到遥控给定。",{"children":"底盘速度解算、云台双环控制、发射热量管理、遥控与 CAN 通信；自瞄开启时云台跟随视觉给定，关闭时回到遥控给定。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","控制",{"id":"section-6","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"06"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"控制"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","速度环配合陀螺零漂补偿，让底盘在长时间运行后依然保持方向一致；云台在自瞄与手动之间做平滑切换，避免突然抖动。",{"children":"速度环配合陀螺零漂补偿，让底盘在长时间运行后依然保持方向一致；云台在自瞄与手动之间做平滑切换，避免突然抖动。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","调试过程",{"id":"section-7","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"07"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"调试过程"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","在场地里实测抓地力、跑圈计时，记录不同加速度参数下的过冲和甩尾情况，一点一点把参数收敛下来。",{"children":"在场地里实测抓地力、跑圈计时，记录不同加速度参数下的过冲和甩尾情况，一点一点把参数收敛下来。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","最终效果",{"id":"section-8","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"08"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"最终效果"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","推进更稳、转向更可控，操作手能预判机器人的运动；自瞄在云台高速转动时依然能稳定跟踪。",{"children":"推进更稳、转向更可控，操作手能预判机器人的运动；自瞄在云台高速转动时依然能稳定跟踪。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","比赛表现",{"id":"section-9","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"09"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"比赛表现"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-n